+# All-versions package manifest
+
+## Contents
+
+- `current_v8/`: current V8.0 local source, tests, requirements, schemas, and the unified V1–V8 roadmap documentation.
+- `historical_archives/`: preserved original ZIP snapshots, copied without modifying their contents.
+- `historical_unclassified/`: two legacy pasted source-text artifacts whose exact version identity could not be verified.
+
+## Version truth table
+
+- V1 and V2: no individually labelled V1/V2 archive or source tree was found. The old generic archives and pasted files are preserved as unclassified legacy material; they are not relabelled.
+- V3: an explicitly named V3.0 ZIP is included.
+- V4: implementation baseline and roadmap are documented in `current_v8/ROADMAP_v4.md`; original V4-only release archive was not found.
+- V5: strengthened roadmap specification included; the full V5 feature set is not implemented in code.
+- V6: formalized design roadmap included; database implementation is not present.
+- V7: local implementation and roadmap are included, with documented governance and validation limitations.
+- V8: local 8.0.0 code implements the JATS figure/table metadata inventory and tests; full visual-card generation and all remaining release gates are not complete.
+
+`clinical_case_flashcards.zip` and `clinical_case_flashcards_reviewed.zip` do not identify themselves as V1 or V2. They are retained by their original names only.
